B.a5S=new A.ec("1. Acceptance of terms",'By accessing or using the Getta Shower mobile application and related services ("Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use ("Terms") and our Privacy Policy. The Service is operated by Experimentar AB (Org. nr: 559578-3274) under the brand "GettaShower". If you do not agree, do not use the Service. We may update these Terms from time to time; your continued use after changes constitutes acceptance. You must be at least 18 years of age to use the Service.')
B.a5I=new A.ec("2. Description of service","Getta Shower provides a listing and discovery platform for shower and hygiene facilities, including host-managed listings and community-submitted free showers. We provide search, map discovery, profiles, reviews, and reporting workflows as an information intermediary. The Service is offered free of charge to end users for discovery purposes. Unless explicitly stated otherwise, we are not the merchant of record for third-party purchases, we do not process on-platform session payments for facility usage, and we are not a party to user-establishment transactions. We do not own, operate, or control physical facilities; Hosts and listing operators are independent parties solely responsible for availability, quality, legality, hygiene, and on-site conditions.")
B.a5Y=new A.ec("3. Account and eligibility","You must register an account and provide accurate, complete information. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account and for all activity under it. You must not share your account or allow others to use it. We may suspend or terminate your account if you breach these Terms or for other legitimate reasons.")
B.a5L=new A.ec("4. Listings and third-party transactions","Getta Shower is a discovery and listings platform. Listing details (including prices, opening hours, entry conditions, amenities, and availability) may be provided by hosts, listing operators, community contributors, or public sources and may be incomplete, inaccurate, or outdated. We may limit visibility or remove content after receiving reports or when required by law and platform integrity rules. Unless explicitly stated otherwise, any purchase, booking, entry, or service is handled directly by the relevant third party, not by GettaShower, and payments are completed off-platform (for example, at the establishment reception).")
B.a5O=new A.ec("5. User conduct","You agree to use the Service only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these Terms. You must not: use the Service in any way that harms others or violates any law; misuse or attempt to gain unauthorised access to any system, data, or account; harass, abuse, or harm other users or Hosts; post false, misleading, abusive, or illegal listing/review/report content; or use the Service to compete with us or to scrape or replicate our platform without permission. We may remove content, restrict features, and suspend or terminate accounts for violations.")
B.a5M=new A.ec("6. Intellectual property","The Service, including its design, text, graphics, logos, and software, is owned by Getta Shower or its licensors and is protected by intellectual property laws. You may not copy, modify, distribute, or create derivative works without our prior written consent. You retain ownership of content you submit; you grant us a licence to use, display, and process that content as needed to provide and improve the Service.")
B.a60=new A.ec("7. Disclaimers",'THE SERVICE AND ALL CONTENT, FACILITIES, AND INFORMATION ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT THE SERVICE WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR-FREE, OR FREE OF HARMFUL COMPONENTS. GETTASHOWER DOES NOT INSPECT FACILITIES, AUDIT MUNICIPAL LICENSES, VERIFY SANITARY CONDITIONS, OR CERTIFY LEGAL COMPLIANCE OF LISTED ESTABLISHMENTS. WE DISCLAIM ALL WARRANTIES REGARDING THE QUALITY, SAFETY, LEGALITY, OR SUITABILITY OF THIRD-PARTY FACILITIES. YOUR USE OF FACILITIES IS AT YOUR OWN RISK; HOSTS ARE INDEPENDENT OPERATORS AND WE ARE NOT RESPONSIBLE FOR THEIR ACTS, OMISSIONS, OR THE CONDITION OF THEIR PREMISES.')
B.a5V=new A.ec("8. Personal safety and third-party conduct","GettaShower is an information and discovery platform. We do not supervise, control, or guarantee the conduct of users, hosts, operators, or other third parties, and we do not provide security, transport, or on-site safety services. To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, all decisions to visit, enter, or use a listed location are made at your own discretion and risk. You are solely responsible for your personal safety, your belongings, and your interactions with third parties. GettaShower does not assume responsibility for accidents, injuries, assaults, harassment, theft, property damage, or other incidents occurring at or in connection with third-party locations or interactions.")
B.a61=new A.ec("9. Limitation of liability","NOTHING IN THESE TERMS EXCLUDES OR LIMITS LIABILITY WHERE SUCH EXCLUSION OR LIMITATION IS PROHIBITED BY MANDATORY LAW, INCLUDING APPLICABLE CONSUMER LAW. SUBJECT TO THAT, AND TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, GETTA SHOWER AND ITS AFFILIATES, OFFICERS, DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, AND AGENTS SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES (INCLUDING LOSS OF PROFITS, DATA, OR GOODWILL), NOR FOR INCIDENTS OCCURRING AT THIRD-PARTY FACILITIES (INCLUDING ACCIDENTS, INJURIES, THEFT, ASSAULT, PROPERTY DAMAGE, SANITARY CONDITIONS, OR ACCESS DECISIONS), ARISING FROM OR RELATED TO YOUR USE OF THE SERVICE OR ANY FACILITY. TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, OUR AGGREGATE LIABILITY FOR CLAIMS ARISING OUT OF OR RELATED TO THESE TERMS OR THE SERVICE SHALL NOT EXCEED THE TOTAL AMOUNT YOU PAID DIRECTLY TO GETTASHOWER FOR THE SERVICE IN THE TWELVE (12) MONTHS BEFORE THE CLAIM AROSE. IF YOU PAID NOTHING TO GETTASHOWER, THAT CAP IS ZERO.")
B.a5N=new A.ec("10. Indemnification","You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless Getta Shower and its affiliates, officers, directors, employees, and agents from and against any claims, damages, losses, liabilities, and expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising out of or related to your use of the Service, your breach of these Terms, your violation of any law or third-party rights, or any dispute between you and a Host or another user.")
B.a5Q=new A.ec("11. Termination","We may suspend or terminate your access to the Service at any time, with or without cause or notice. You may stop using the Service at any time. Upon termination, your right to use the Service ceases immediately. Provisions that by their nature should survive (including disclaimers, limitation of liability, indemnification, and governing law) will survive termination.")
B.a5T=new A.ec("12. Governing law and disputes","These Terms are governed by the laws of Sweden, without regard to conflict-of-law principles and without prejudice to mandatory consumer law rights in your country of residence. Any dispute arising out of or relating to these Terms or the Service shall be resolved in the courts of Sweden, except where mandatory law requires otherwise. If you are a consumer in the European Union, you may also have the right to use EU dispute resolution platforms.")
B.a5H=new A.ec("13. Host insurance and compliance","Any contractual requirement to maintain commercial liability insurance (or equivalent legally required coverage) applies only to Hosts that complete GettaShower verification and enter a separate paid B2B premium subscription agreement with Experimentar AB. Listings sourced from public data, community submissions, or non-contracted establishments are not, by this Terms document alone, represented as insured, verified, or contractually bound to Experimentar AB. GettaShower monetization is based on optional B2B listing and visibility services for contracted Hosts, not on consumer payment processing for facility use.")
B.a5G=new A.ec("14. Changes","We may modify these Terms at any time. We will notify you of material changes via the app or by other reasonable means. Continued use of the Service after the effective date of changes constitutes acceptance. If you do not agree, you must stop using the Service.")
B.a5P=new A.ec("15. Severability and entire agreement","If any provision of these Terms is held invalid or unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in effect. These Terms, together with our Privacy Policy and any other policies referenced herein, constitute the entire agreement between you and Getta Shower regarding the Service.")
B.a5J=new A.ec("16. Contact","For questions about these Terms of Use, please contact us at info@gettashower.com.")
